<PageLayout title="About This Site" description="The people and tools behind blake.pm.">
<section class="mx-auto max-w-screen-md px-5 pt-32 pb-20"><article>
<h1 class="page-heading">About This Site</h1>
<p>This is my small corner of the web: a place to write, experiment, and make something personal.</p>
<h2>A Good Starting Point</h2>
<p>The site began with <a href="https://github.com/markhorn-dev/astro-sphere">Astro Sphere</a>, a theme created by <a href="https://markhorn.dev">Mark Horn</a>. Its quiet, celestial design drew me in. You can explore the <a href="https://astro-sphere-demo.vercel.app">original theme demo</a> and see where this version started.</p>
<h2>Built With</h2>
<p><a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a> turns the content into fast, static pages. Tailwind CSS helps with styling, and small pieces of JavaScript bring the stars, atmosphere controls, and occasional visitor to life. The animations use CSS and SVG.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.cloudflare.com">Cloudflare</a> hosts the site. The <a href="https://github.com/blakemitchell/blake-pm">source code lives on GitHub</a>.</p>
<p>Design direction and content by Blake Mitchell. Modifications to the site made with Codex.</p>
<p>Thanks to the people building and sharing the tools that make a personal website like this possible.</p>
</article></section>
</PageLayout>
